---
import Button from '../ui/Button.astro';
import SectionHeader from '../ui/SectionHeader.astro';
import ScrollReveal from '../ui/ScrollReveal.astro';
---

<section class="section-y bg-bone">
  <div class="container-edge">
    <ScrollReveal class="mx-auto max-w-[720px] text-center">
      <SectionHeader
        eyebrow="Capacity"
        title="Eight families per quarter."
      />

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-6 text-left text-[1.05rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-muted md:text-[1.1rem]">
        <p>
          Because the EA is the entire product, and one Spanish-speaking EA can only hold ten active relocations at the fractional level required to be excellent. Eight is the number where the EA has slack to be excellent and not just adequate. We will not break this ratio.
        </p>
        <p>
          That means: <strong class="font-medium text-ink">eight families per quarter, and the inaugural cohort is the cohort opening June 1, 2026.</strong> Founder pricing of $30,000 is for these eight. Standard pricing of $45,000 begins Q4 2026 and does not retroactively apply.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you want this and you read this far, the rational move is to book the discovery call now and decide on it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 flex justify-center">
        <Button href="#book" variant="primary" size="lg">
          Book your discovery call <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </Button>
      </div>
    </ScrollReveal>
  </div>
</section>
